<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK NOV DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.69 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK NOV DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.69 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Wednesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 5.69 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Nov 15			7,300</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Nov		6,362</p>
<p> Average reserves to Nov 12			   7,373</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    5,689</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
